WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.299
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:06.966
(drone propellers thumping)

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.511
[Drone] Citizens, remain calm.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.263
Alpha Team, assemble. C formation.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:21.010
[Drone] Copy, Orange Leader.
Standing by to targets.

00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:25.208
(drones buzzing)

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:27.875
(birds singing)

00:00:28.873 --> 00:00:31.825
(drones buzzing)

00:00:31.825 --> 00:00:35.492
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:43.659
[Drone] Ladies and
gentlemen, do not be alarmed.

00:00:43.659 --> 00:00:48.659
This is a socially-distant
delivery from Conan O'Brien.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.718
Stand back. Delivery incoming.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.551
Oh man.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.800
[Drone] Where's the drop button?

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.633
Whoops.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.564
Oh my god.

00:00:59.564 --> 00:01:01.230
[Drone] Delivery successful.

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.813
I'm kinda scared.

00:01:05.129 --> 00:01:07.351
Oh my god!
Oh my god! It's Funko Pops!

00:01:07.351 --> 00:01:08.768
[Audience] Wow!

00:01:11.689 --> 00:01:13.470
Conan as Wonder Woman.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:14.920
Chucky.
It's Aquaman.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.600
Marty McFly.
Dr. Ian Malcolm.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.790
We're gonna need a bigger boat.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:21.710
[Drone] Sir, you've got
the wrong Spielberg movie.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:22.857
So many Conans.

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:25.054
[Drone] Goodbye, humans.

00:01:25.054 --> 00:01:26.140
Conan!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:28.140
[Drone] Enjoy your viral collectibles.

